Task 2: Create and configure secure blob storage
1.Azure portal-> Storage accounts->select a storage account -> Data storage -> Containers -> Create using  
Setting | Value |
    | --- | --- |
    | Name | `data`  |
    | Public access level | Notice the access level is set to private |
2. Open the created container -> Access policy -> Add policy -> Legal hold-> Time-based retention 
 | Setting | Value |
    | --- | --- |
    | Policy type | **Time-based retention**  |
    | Set retention period for | `180` days |
3. Save
